src/main/resources/blockstate/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Block state differences between two Minecraft versions, used to translate block
network ids across a version step.

  Derived from: Mojang/bedrock-samples, metadata/vanilladata_modules/
                mojang-blocks.json  https://github.com/Mojang/bedrock-samples

These files are a diff of two published versions of that metadata, reduced to the
blocks whose property set changed. They carry block and property names and their
legal values -- protocol facts needed to speak to the game -- and no Mojang code
or assets. Each file records the two versions it was diffed from.

